# Canonical line endings: text is stored and checked out with LF on every host.
#
# Windows defaults to `core.autocrlf=true`, which rewrites text files to CRLF on
# checkout. That leaks into the suite as CRLF fixtures, generated documents that
# no longer match their LF renderer, and source text that differs per host. The
# attribute applies to every path Git detects as text; the binary assets this
# repository tracks are listed explicitly so the classification cannot drift.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise or diff these as text.
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
